# Code owners for qti-pie, set by @aidenzepp on 2026-11-09.
#
# These paths carry the project's rules and its evidence: the specification
# readings, the QTI intent, the agent rules, the committed migrations, every
# test, and the renderer package. With code-owner review required on main, a
# change to any of them needs @aidenzepp's approval. Paths not listed here have
# no code owner.
#
# Syntax: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
# The last matching pattern wins. Every line names the same owner, so no line
# overrides another. A pattern with no slash (*.test.ts) matches at any depth;
# a pattern with a leading or middle slash is anchored at the repository root.

*.test.ts                  @aidenzepp
packages/*/migrations/**   @aidenzepp
packages/plate/**          @aidenzepp
/AGENTS.md                 @aidenzepp
/docs/qti-intent.md        @aidenzepp
/docs/spec-readings.md     @aidenzepp
